sequenceDiagram
    participant App as Your app
    participant SDK as Client SDK
    participant C as Your contract
    participant CoFHE as CoFHE

    Note over App,CoFHE: Encrypt
    App->>SDK: plaintext value
    SDK->>CoFHE: encrypted input + ZK proof
    CoFHE-->>SDK: signed encrypted handle
    SDK->>C: tx with handle

    Note over C,CoFHE: Compute
    C->>C: FHE.add / FHE.lt / FHE.select ...
    C->>C: derive result handle (deterministic)
    Note over C,CoFHE: operation emitted onchain, nothing returns to the contract
    CoFHE->>CoFHE: pick up operation, compute ciphertext for the same handle

    Note over App,CoFHE: Decrypt
    App->>SDK: read result (+ ACP)
    SDK->>CoFHE: decrypt request
    CoFHE-->>SDK: sealed result, or a signed plaintext
    SDK-->>App: revealed value
